{"id":77659,"slug":"acapulco-2021","title":"Acapulco","title_en":null,"year":2021,"rating":75,"votes_count":115,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"seriál","vod_date":null,"plot":"V roce 1984 se Máximu Gallardovi splní sen, když dostane zaměstnání snů v Las Colinas, nejvyhledávanějším resortu Acapulca. Brzo ale zjistí, že práce v resortu bude mnohem složitější, než si představoval.(Apple TV+)","poster":"https://image.pmgstatic.com/cache/resized/w140/files/images/film/posters/165/677/165677884_1d3ac2.jpg","backdrop":null,"trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Komedie"],"tags":[],"countries":["USA"],"directors":["Jaime Eliezer Karas","Tristram Shapeero","Roberto Sneider","Richard Shepard","Dean Holland","Victor Nelli Jr.","Nicole Treston Abranian","Claire Scanlon","Catalina Aguilar Mastretta","Austin Winsberg","Óscar Javier Almengor"],"actors":["Eugenio Derbez","Enrique Arrizon","Vanessa Bauche","Rafael Cebrián","Jessica Collins","Steve Monroe","Chord Overstreet","Camila Perez","Regina Reynoso","Jim Garrity","Damián Alcázar","Raphael Alejandro","Caleb Foote","Kennedy Lea Slocum","Samantha Orozco","Sofia Ruiz","Anna Grace Barlow","Alex MacNicoll","Eliana Jones","Julian Sedgwick","Carlos Corona","Jeff Meacham","Regina Orozco","Simon Templeman","Fernando Carsa","Carolina Torres","Daniel Fuentes Lobo","Tina French","Luis Romano","Mara Vargas Jackson","Mara Cuevas","Bianca Marroquin","Lobo Elías","Kevin Kilner","Will Sasso","Bayardo De Murguia","Hemky Madera","Wendie Malick","Kevin Dunn","Danny Jacobs","Marilyn Uribe","Gustavo Gomez","Gabriela Milla","Connor Weil","Gjermund Gjesme","Francisco Calvillo","Mauro González","Cristo Fernández","Karen Rodriguez","Carolina Gómez","Vico Escorcia","Jaime Camil","Rodrigo Urquidi","Rossana De León","Gala Montes","Valeria Russek","Keyla Monterroso Mejia","Evangelina Martínez","Roberto Wohlmuth","Emma Ferreira","Noureen DeWulf","Ilse Apellaniz","Omar Chaparro","Gerardo Saldaña"],"screenwriters":["Austin Winsberg","Jason Shuman","Eduardo Cisneros","Mara Vargas Jackson","Becky Mann","Audra Sielaff","John Aboud","Michael Colton","Tamara Yajia","Eddie Quintana","Joe Cristalli","Chris Harris","Jonathan Green","Maggie Feakins","Nico Correia","Ilse Apellaniz","Michael Lisbe","Nate Reger","Robert Sudduth","Hailey Chavez","Jason Belleville","Bernardo Cubria","Celeste Klaus","Francisco Cabrera-Feo","Gonzalo Lomeli","Sam Laybourne"],"cinematographers":["Grant Smith","Eduardo Enrique Mayén"],"composers":["Bo Boddie"],"reviews":[{"author":"Broxi","text":"Dvojjazyčný seriál ako stvorený na leto najprv diváka zaujme vizuálne, potom svojou pohodovou atmosférou, humorom a neskôr čistou dávkou pozitívnej energie. Okrem dômyselného scenára poteší aj osemdesiatkový soudtrack. Prvá séria bola výrazne silnejšia ako ďalšie dve, ale aj tie sú dostatočne pútavé na to aby ste ich dopozerali dokonca. Je to dobrá príležitosť ako spoznať mexickú kultúru a naučiť sa nejaký ten španielsky slang. Que padre! Už sa teším na ďalšiu sériu.(24.09.2024)","stars":4},{"author":"M.i.k.e","text":"Acapulco je středně zábavná jednohubka o tom jak Eugenio Derbez vypráví svému synovci o tom jak za mlada pracoval v hotelu a postupně se v něm snažil někam vypracovat,stihl se zamilovat atd atd.Čistá komedie to úplně není,protože opravdu funkčního humoru je tu pomálu,ale jako celek neurazí,nicméně ani nijak extra nenadchne.Apple má ve své stáji podstatně lepší kousky...60%(11.12.2021)","stars":3},{"author":"Ivoshek","text":"Takový feel-good seriál. Není to nějak třeskutě vtipné, spíš se u toho člověk tak usmívá. Jediná otravná postava je ten kluk, ten mi svým přehráváním lezl strašně na nervy. Naštěstí ho tam není tolik.(20.09.2023)","stars":3}],"vods":[{"platform":"Apple TV","url":"https://srv.clickfuse.com/ads/adclkr.php?id=100006636&url=https%3A//tv.apple.com/cz/show/acapulco/umc.cmc.8xrkg9zywke7g6a9ahmvpr3l"},{"platform":"Canal+","url":"https://www.canalplus.cz/stream/series/acapulco/serie-1/epizoda-1/?utm_campaign=vod_content&ut